{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q33", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2017和2019年发生了什么事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，身弱喜木火。2017年丁酉，流年天干丁火为比肩帮身，但地支酉金为偏财，与月柱、日柱酉金形成三酉冲一巳（时支巳火），且酉酉自刑，金旺克木（印星受制），火根被冲，主该年有变动、健康或子女宫（时柱）受冲击之事。2019年己亥，流年天干己土食神，地支亥水正官，亥与命局巳火相冲（时支），且亥水克巳火，食神制杀，但冲克子女宫，亦主生育或子女方面之事。\n\n结合2017年三酉冲巳（时柱为子女宫），2019年亥巳冲（再次冲击子女宫），且命主1980年生，2017年37岁，2019年39岁，正值生育年龄末期。两度冲克子女宫，且金水旺而火弱，易有流产或生育不顺之象。选项中“开刀生小孩”需有手术信息，但命局无明确手术象；“交通意外”与子女宫冲克关联弱；“考取文凭失利”与印星受制有关，但2017年比肩帮身，2019年食神制杀，学业非重点。综合两次冲克子女宫，且火弱难孕，最可能为流产。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "4e4a7b64fe0e49fa2959bbe673c837c8cf8ea862ebac83d3ec77c6291dae0028", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q33", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4712, "response_id": "60b1905e-bb8a-40a7-b96f-a7ad7871d188", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 440, "completion_tokens": 330, "total_tokens": 770, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 56}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
